 City</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Agrupacion Sierra Madre,Mexico</publisher-name><fpage>392</fpage></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing Interests: </bold>WA Gray is a member of the UK delegation of voting participants on the governing board of GBIF. FA Bisby &#x00026; RJ White are part of the Species 2000 delegation which is an Associate participant on the governing board of GBIF.</p></fn><fn fn-type="financial-disclosure"><p><bold>Funding: </bold>BBSRC (grant 45/BEP17792 for BiodiversityWorld) employed some authors whilst writing manuscript. University of Reading studentship for CY.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>